flowchart LR
  MANIFEST[Manifest Reader] --> SCHED[Persistent Scheduler]
  JOURNAL[SQLite Journal] <--> SCHED
  SCHED --> POLICY[Destination Policy]
  POLICY --> DIAL[Pinned Dialer]
  DIAL --> HTTP[Bounded HTTP Executor]
  HTTP --> RECEIVER[Receiver]
  HTTP --> JOURNAL
  SCHED --> RECOVERY[Recovery / Ambiguity Engine]
  RECOVERY <--> JOURNAL
